ssible lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  Both possible nodes are bisected and submitted in toto with the larger in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the smaller in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received are two containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received in formalin  labeled  left breast tissue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  anular portion of tan white skin  which is inked black and representative sections are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  right breast tissue   is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  tan white skin excised to a depth of 0 6cm  which is inked black  serially sectioned and representative sections are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART C  SKIN  LEFT BREAST   EXCISION PART D  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   SENTINEL     REMOVED_CASE_ID    EXCISION PART E  SKIN  BREAST LEFT   EXCISION PART F  SKIN  BREAST RIGHT   EXCISION  report_end  , Unchecked.
Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  18 REMOVED_MONTH 03 ACCESSIONED ON  18 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 15 13 CLINICAL DATA  Left breast cancer  reviewed at BWH  prophylactic mastectomy                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY  SENTINEL   EXCISION  METASTATIC DUCTAL CARCINOMA  TUMOR SPANNING   REMOVED_DATE CM IN GREATEST DIMENSION IN A REMOVED_DATE CM NODE   WITHOUT EXTRANODAL EXTENSION  SEE NOTE  NOTE  The focus of metastatic ductal carcinoma seen on a permanent slide is not present on the frozen section slide  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY  FIBROCYSTIC CHANGES  HARBORING CALCIFICATIONS  HEALING BIOPSY SITE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY  FIBROCYSTIC CHANGES  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  THE FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS IS CONFIRMED  Diagnosis by  John H  Eichhorn  M D  Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 19 33                                                                                 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a 300g  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 3cm left simple mastectomy specimen with an attached REMOVED_DATE x 3 7cm of tan pink skin with a central unremarkable REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm nipple  There is a 3 3cm healed linear scar along the lateral aspect which comes to 0 2cm of the margin  A white stitch designates the 12 o clock position as per requisition  The resection margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm hemorrhagic cavity  consistent with previous biopsy site  which comes to 0 6cm of the deep margin  Surrounding the cavity are yellow orange foci  consistent with fat necrosis  The surrounding and distant fibrous tissue is focally dense and nodular to cystic with no discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities  Sectioning of the lateral tissue reveals no apparent lymph nodes  and representative sections are submitted as follows  A D  Hemorrhagic cavity with deep margin as A C  E  Representative fibrous tissue  medial to cavity  F  Representative fibrous tissue  lateral to cavity  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a 320 gram  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 9cm right mastectomy specimen with an attached REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm tan pink skin ellipse  There is a central REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm unremarkable nipple  and no scar is grossly appreciated  A black stitch designates the 12 o clock aspect as per requisition  The resection margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm ill defined tan irregular area  1 5cm of the deep margin  A representative section of this area to the deep margin  Representative section of this area to the deep margin is submitted for frozen section as FX 2  now as G  The remaining shows unremarkable fibrofatty breast tissue  The fibrous tissue surrounding the ill defined areas is submitted as H  Representative sections of the fibrous tissue lateral to this area is submitted as I  and representative fibrous tissue medial to this areas is submitted as J  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary sentinel lymph node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan  fatty lymph node  which is bisected and entirely submitted for frozen as FX 1  now as K  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  PAULA ARNELL  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  LEFT SENTINEL   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  RIGHT BREAST  TAN AREA  DEEP   SMALL FOCUS OF APOCRINE METAPLASIA  NO CARCINOMA IS SEEN  O R 