d or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  26 REMOVED_MONTH 01 at 12 04 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast sentinel node biopsy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm lymph node  entirely frozen as FX 1  which is now submitted as A in entirety  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  non sentinel lymph node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm aggregate of yellow fatty tissue  The larger piece is bisected to reveal a lymph node measuring 1 4cm in greatest dimension  This is entirely submitted in B  The smaller piece of tissue is bisected to reveal a lymph node measuring 0 6cm in greatest dimension  This is entirely submitted in C  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x 3 x 2 0cm piece of fibrofatty breast tissue  The surgeon has oriented the specimen with the long stitch lateral and the short stitch superior  The superior half of the specimen is inked blue  the inferior half is inked black  and the anterior edge is over inked in orange  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal an ill defined area that is firm and gritty  This area measures 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  and is entirely submitted in D I  from medial to lateral  with closest margins  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  final shaved margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x 2 x 1 5cm piece of fibrofatty breast tissue  The surgeon has oriented the specimen with a stitch along the surface furthest from the biopsy cavity  This surface is inked in black  The entire