ing from REMOVED_DATE to 1 5cm in greatest dimension are identified  Section code  A D  representative sections of biopsy cavity  E  closest inked deep margin in relation to biopsy cavity  F J  representative sections of firm ill defined area anterior to the biopsy cavity  K O  representative lymph nodes  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
