 tissue  The largest one measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm and has an attached grossly unremarkable ellipse of skin measuring REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm irregular white tan firm nodular mass extending along a broad front to the deep margin  A REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm hemorrhagic area is noted at 1 5cm from the tumor  The remainder of the breast is adipose with large white firm areas  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A B  tumor C  hemorrhagic area D  representative section from the remainder of the breast The smaller fragment measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and shows a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm irregular white tan hard nodular mass present along a broad front on one of the specimen margins  The positive margin is inked in black and the opposite margin is inked in blue  The remainder of the specimen shows large white firm areas  Representative sections are submitted as follows  E G  tumor H  remainder of the specimen A frozen section performed on each part  I  frozen section from large specimen  J  frozen section from smaller specimen  Gross Description by  SELIM NASSER  MD Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LARGER PIECE   INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  PRESENT IN BOTH PIECES  AT INK  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  SMALLER PIECE   INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  PRESENT IN BOTH PIECES  AT INK  O R  Resident  SELIM NASSER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Suzanne B  Keel  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
