t was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  10 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 16 20 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  are three specimens  Labeled  right breast biopsy re excision   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm breast re excision specimen with a REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm skin ellipse containing a 3 0cm well healed linear scar  There s an undesignated short suture on one aspect which is inked in black  with the opposite section inked in blue  There s undesignated long suture present on another aspect  There s a previously opened biopsy cavity measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  It is lined by a tan pink smooth shiny membrane  It is less than 0 1cm from the nearest margin and 0 4cm from skin ellipse  Biopsy cavity is surrounded by scattered focally tan yellow nodules measuring 0 3cm in greatest dimension  Section Code  A  deep margin  B E  biopsy cavity  F  biopsy cavity and uninvolved parenchyma  Labeled  right axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm portion of adipose tissue upon which multiple lymph nodes are extracted and submitted in cassettes G O  Labeled as  right breast shaved node   are two fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm in aggregate  submitted entirely in cassettes O P  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm firm lymmph node frozen entirely as FX 1  now in Q  Resident  D